<title>NEW ZEALAND: Otter Gold year net profit rises steeply.</title>
<headline>Otter Gold year net profit rises steeply.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  6.25 vs 1.21</p>
<p>    Div					    nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 13.8 vs 2.7</p>
<p>    Turnover				    37.7 vs 19.1</p>
<p>    Abnormal credit before tax	     3.6 vs n/a</p>
<p>Pretax profit				8.6 vs 2.4</p>
<p>    Tax					    1.9 vs 1.6</p>
<p>    Minority interests		 debit 0.4 vs 0.5 credit</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  39.4 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - Otter Gold Mines Ltd is a gold mining company. The abnormal credit of $3.58 million before tax related to an award of damages arising from the company's claim to pre-emptive rights under the Martha Hill joint venture.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
